<title>USA: Allmerica Property &amp; Casualty Q4 shr flat.</title>
<headline>Allmerica Property &amp; Casualty Q4 shr flat.</headline>
<dateline>WORCESTER, Mass. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>ALLMERICA PROPERTY &amp; CASUALTY COMPANIES, INC.</p>
<p>		     (In millions, except per share data)</p>
<p>					  Quarter ended   Year ended</p>
<p>					   December 31    December 31</p>
<p>				 1996	  1995     1996	 1995</p>
<p> Net income(A)	    $27.4	 $27.9   $146.4     $140.1</p>
<p> Net income per share    0.46	  0.46     2.44	 2.28</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>				 59.7	  61.1     59.9	 61.4</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 includes $1.3 million of after-tax realized investment gains, net of minority interest and a $0.6 million after-tax and minority interest severance charge.</p>
<p>1995 Q4 includes $0.2 million of after-tax net realized investment losses, net of minority interest.</p>
<p>1996 year includes $29.4 million of after-tax realized investment gains, net of minority interest and a $0.6 million after-tax and minority interest severance charge.</p>
<p>1995 year includes $9.0 million of after-tax net realized gains, net of minority interest.</p>
